               <span style="font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">gemäß geotechnischem Bericht.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
