              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">konstruktiven Erfordernissen liefern und einbauen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">1. Bauteil = </span>
               <TextComplement MarkLbl="61" Kind="Owner">
                <ComplCaption/>
                <ComplBody>
